@* Six variants ship. A seventh is a class, not a new variant — and if it is written with theme
   tokens it follows a theme change, while a literal colour does not. *@
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
    <Badge Class="bg-emerald-600 text-white dark:bg-emerald-500">Paid</Badge>
    <Badge Class="bg-amber-500 text-amber-950">Pending</Badge>
    <Badge Variant="outline" Class="border-primary/40 text-primary">Follows the theme</Badge>
</div>
